Step back into the colorful, psychedelic era of the 1970s with Boldfat Mighty, a bold, bubbly, and unapologetically retro display typeface crafted by Alit Design Studio. Bursting with cheerful energy and a distinctly quirky personality, this font is designed to make your projects pop with nostalgic fun and "peace stuffs" vibes.\cb1 \
\cb3 Whether you are designing a far-out festival poster, vibrant streetwear apparel, or eye-catching packaging, Boldfat Mighty delivers that authentic vintage look with a playful, chunky weight that commands attention.\

